        "faq-17": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "goods-products-availability",
            "question": "If an item is out of stock, how can I find out if and when it will be available?",
            "answer": "<p>If a particular size is not available on our website, in most cases we do not restock the products, as we update our collections annually. However, it may happen that some items are returned by customers and subsequently restocked on an ongoing basis. Availability can therefore only be checked periodically directly on our website. Unfortunately, we do not currently oƯer the option to track availability or receive email notifications when a product is restocked. <br/><br/></p>"
