            "question": "Can you check the availability of a specific item at a partner store?",
            "answer": "<p>Our warehouse is not connected to the systems of partner stores, so we cannot check the availability of items at individual stores. For this reason, we also do not have information about the stock levels of a specific product at specific retail locations. </p>"
