        "faq-20": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "What is the warranty period for the products?",
            "answer": "<p>The warranty period for all products is 24 months from the date of purchase. You can find more detailed information on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Complaint” section. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-21": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "How can I return an order?",
            "answer": "<p>Goods can be returned within 14 days of delivery. To process a return, you must fill out the form included with the shipment (or available on our website), enclose it with the goods in the package, and then send the package to the address provided.</p><p>Detailed information on how to proceed with a return is available on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Complaint” section.</p><p>We do not accept cash-on-delivery shipments, so please keep your shipping receipt. We will notify you via email once we have received and processed the returned goods. The return will be processed within 14 days at the latest. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-22": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "When and how will I receive my refund?",
            "answer": "<p>Once we receive the returned goods, we will refund the purchase price within 14 days. If you paid by card through a payment gateway, the refund will be credited to the account associated with that card. However, if you paid via cash on delivery, we will refund the money via bank transfer. Therefore, in this case, you must provide your account number on the form.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-23": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "Where can I find the claim form?",
            "answer": "<p>The claim form is available on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Claim for Goods” section </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-24": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "How long does it take to process a refund?",
            "answer": "<p>We will refund the purchase price within 14 days of receiving the returned goods. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-25": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "How long does it take to exchange an item, and when will I receive the replacement?",
            "answer": "<p>The legal deadline for processing an exchange is 14 days from the delivery of the shipment to our address. We typically send replacement items to the same address where the original order was delivered. If you wish to have the item sent to a diƯerent address, please indicate this directly on the exchange form or notify us of the change via email. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-26": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "exchanges-returns-and-warranty-claims",
            "question": "Can I exchange an item purchased from your online store for a completely diƯerent item?",
            "answer": "<p>Unfortunately, we do not oƯer this option. We can only exchange the item for the same model in a diƯerent size or color, depending on availability. Product reservations are not possible. If the requested product is not available at the time of processing, we will refund the customer. </p>"
          }
        },
